  "bugs_found_by_this_matrix": [
    "rerank was impossible to configure from a file: the section was key-checked against {provider, options, top_n} while the option extraction assumed flat siblings, so every shape of a non-`none` rerank was rejected. Fixed in the same commit; tests added.",
    "rerank also could not be exercised before, which is why the previously recorded eval/results/hybrid_qwen3-0.6b_rerank_bge-v2-m3.json (recall@10 0.875, p50 20,489 ms) had no reproducible config path."
  ],
  "caveats": [
